---
import "./disclaimer.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="ViralMMSVideo Brand Disclaimer covering brand identity, AI-generated media, adult content, reporting, takedown requests, and content redistribution."
    />

    <title>Brand Disclaimer — ViralMMSVideo</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./disclaimer.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <!-- Top Legal Navigation -->
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="site-header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="site-brand"> ViralMMSVideo </a>

        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Legal navigation">
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/dmca-policy">DMCA</a>
          <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
          <a href="/disclaimer" class="active">Disclaimer</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Floating Back Button -->
    <a
      href="javascript:history.back()"
      class="back-button"
      aria-label="Go back"
      title="Go back"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">←</span>
    </a>

    <main class="policy-container">
      <header class="policy-header">
        <div class="brand">ViralMMSVideo</div>

        <h1>Brand Disclaimer</h1>

        <p>Information regarding our brand names and identities.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2>Brand Name Disclaimer</h2>

        <p>
          <strong>ViralMMSVideo</strong> is our primary brand name. The name <strong
            >"ViralMMSVideo"</strong
          > is used solely as a brand and business identifier and is not intended
          to have any literal, dictionary, colloquial, or descriptive meaning in relation
          to our company, services, website, products, content, or business activities.
        </p>

        <p>
          The individual words or terms contained within the brand name
          <strong>"ViralMMSVideo"</strong>, whether considered separately or
          together, should not be interpreted as describing, defining, or
          representing the nature, purpose, or activities of our company or
          services.
        </p>

        <p>
          We may also operate or provide services through other brands, names,
          domains, websites, applications, or social media identities, including
          but not limited to
          <strong>ViralDekho</strong>,
          <strong>Viral MMS Dekho</strong>, and
          <strong>ViralMMS Instagram</strong>, as well as other brands that may
          be introduced in the future.
        </p>

        <p>
          All such names are used as brand identities and should not be
          interpreted solely on the basis of their individual words or their
          ordinary or literal meanings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2>AI-Generated and Synthetic Media</h2>

        <p>
          Our platform may contain videos, images, characters, scenes, or other
          media that are created, modified, or recreated using artificial
          intelligence (AI), generative technology, or other synthetic-media
          tools.
        </p>

        <p>
          AI-generated or AI-assisted content may depict fictional characters or
          digitally recreated representations. The fact that content has been
          generated or modified using AI does not, by itself, mean that it is
          associated with, endorsed by, authorized by, or created by any real
          person who may appear to be depicted.
        </p>

        <p>
          Where content involves a recognizable real person, including an actor,
          public figure, or other individual, users must comply with all
          applicable laws, rights of publicity, privacy rights,
          intellectual-property rights, and our platform policies.
        </p>

        <p>
          We do not permit content that unlawfully impersonates, exploits,
          harasses, or violates the rights of an individual.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2>Adult Content</h2>

        <p>
          Certain content on the platform may contain mature, romantic,
          suggestive, or otherwise adult-oriented themes and is intended
          strictly for users who are
          <strong>18 years of age or older</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Adult or mature content should not be interpreted as automatically
          being pornographic. However, content that violates our applicable
          content standards, legal requirements, or other platform policies may
          be removed regardless of whether it was created using AI.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2>Reporting and Takedown Requests</h2>

        <p>
          If you believe that a video or other content violates your rights, our
          policies, or applicable law, please use our
          <a href="/dmca-policy">Video Takedown Request</a>
          process and provide the relevant information necessary for us to review
          the matter.
        </p>

        <p>
          We review valid reports and takedown requests in accordance with our
          applicable policies and legal obligations. Submission of a report does
          not automatically guarantee removal of the reported content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-section">
        <h2>Removal and Re-Upload Disclaimer</h2>

        <p>
          Although we may remove content from our platform when appropriate, we
          cannot guarantee that content removed from our platform will never
          appear elsewhere on the internet.
        </p>

        <p>
          Content may have been copied, downloaded, re-uploaded, mirrored,
          archived, or redistributed by third parties without our knowledge or
          control.
        </p>

        <p>
          Accordingly, removal of content from our platform does not guarantee
          removal of the same content from other websites, platforms, services,
          search engines, archives, or third-party systems.
        </p>

        <p>
          Users should understand that our ability to control content is
          generally limited to our own services and systems.
        </p>
      </section>

      <footer class="policy-footer">
        <p>© 2026 ViralMMSVideo. All rights reserved.</p>

        <nav class="policy-links" aria-label="Footer legal links">
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/dmca-policy">DMCA Policy</a>
          <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
          <a href="/disclaimer">Brand Disclaimer</a>
        </nav>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
